<title>USA: Tech Data to distribute QUALCOMM software.</title>
<headline>Tech Data to distribute QUALCOMM software.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>QUALCOMM Inc on Thursday said Tech Data Corp had agreed to distribute QUALCOMM's Eudora Internet e-mail software to its North American reseller and retail customers.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;As Tech Data concentrates on...Latin American markets, we look forward to expanding our retail presence and reaching new market segments,&quot; Ann Schrader, director of worldwide sales for QUALCOMM, said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
